{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0423_1000_p", "source_sha256": "21553d27cedfd5dc6bbb21777cff209bd58d7159d618a81ad47b243eab953f76", "ja": "（ボーカル＆ダンスエリアでのパフォーマンス、\n歩は鮮やかに決めてみせた！）", "zh": "（步在歌唱与舞蹈区域的表演中，展现出了精彩的表现！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0423_1001_p", "source_sha256": "37bfee7056af60a7c62d37639687c75926ffdae1d3015385139a7b749fd1533b", "ja": "歩、お疲れさま！　ダンスはもちろんだけど、\nボーカルもすごく良かったぞ！", "zh": "步，辛苦了！舞蹈当然不用说，歌唱也非常棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0423_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cb52e1219c1f59ef3fd00ae459f283c35644f2b4d366634a1b40e21bd36223b5", "ja": "サンキュー！　まだ結果はわからないけど、\n今出せる力は出しきったよ！", "zh": "谢谢！虽然还不知道结果，\n但我已经把现在能拿出的实力全都拿出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0423_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b9abf3f5177866b3542748b9c067235a2d646108f6d7b573110d9e358150385b", "ja": "歌も、目いっぱい特訓したし。それでさ、\n{$P$}。わかったことがあるんだ！", "zh": "唱歌也已经拼尽全力特训过了。而且啊，{$P$}，我发现了一件事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0423_1004_p", "source_sha256": "595ed4b7052de724bbe03fb97ae712ec61ac1164489e562f8c4dd9a62dd21ed9", "ja": "おお、なんだ？", "zh": "哦，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0423_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "344c541e94ad673dd75f039dcb66dead2bb712cc346b9729c41822a2650db8ff", "ja": "歌に自信がつくと、ダンスのパフォーマンスも\nキレが増すってこと。迷いがなくなるんだなって。", "zh": "对歌曲有了自信，舞蹈的表现力也会更上一层楼。因为不再有迷茫了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0423_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3ccf3acfbd9dd9954e703e8a61357e59754a07abdade302b33b0a0813651e681", "ja": "そりゃ、まだまだ完璧とは言えないけどさ。\nでも、アタシなりにがんばったし！って。", "zh": "虽说还不能算完美啦。\n不过，我也已经尽了自己的努力！就是这种感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0423_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b682518e4a5e904b6e40ed46460141d3d3da24391bc013ffdfe3f42eed71cd4d", "ja": "そしたら、身も心も軽く感じられたっていうか……。\n今、すっごくやりきったぞ～！って感じ！", "zh": "这样一来，感觉身心都变得轻快了……怎么说呢。\n现在特别有种“终于彻底完成了～！”的感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0423_1008_p", "source_sha256": "78f40b64d746e86f8654f31410c20f9f6e306cb493df07ae26e44e7f3c1a2263", "ja": "うん、見ていてわかったよ。いつにも増して\n迫力があったし……今も、達成感が顔に出てる。", "zh": "嗯，我在旁边看着也感受到了。不仅比平时\n更有气势……现在脸上也写满了成就感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0423_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e5e91953e89142215db1d8dbf3f8e08af254db7af5cc59ac6306bed929f59eec", "ja": "ホントに！？　……後は、結果がついてくれば\nいいんだけど。相手もすごかったからな～。", "zh": "真的吗！？……接下来要是能有个好结果就好了。对手也很厉害啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0423_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c9e02e0a12e26f838e7dffe73fd61353f1fad8dd558aadbe1623a57d078a2bc6", "ja": "（外国人の観客が話しかけてきた。\nこれは、歩を称賛しているようだが……）", "zh": "（外国观众来跟我搭话了。看样子是在称赞步，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0423_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "df1c3aadd5a671f5c7b067893c01c2eb93393138b51cf626f832be7dd3000b86", "ja": "オー、サンキューサンキュー。ユアウェルカム。", "zh": "哦，谢谢谢谢。你太客气了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0423_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f1f6fe1bafe94299f415b4acfcdfb1dbf7fe8523ba835cf39a79e8057641fa9a", "ja": "歩？　なんだって？", "zh": "步？你说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0423_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8a1d145793d9cc565bc46bcd7d15b2609865c3733c630a0a8752c55444f72078", "ja": "え？　ああ、うん！", "zh": "诶？啊，嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0423_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "baa82fc7a6819cdefcf12e25a92aa1f811e21016dfac9990b8dd46b78b1219a3", "ja": "アタシのダンスを褒めてくれてる。\nそれなら話は早いよ。……ほら！", "zh": "你是在夸我的舞蹈啊。\n那就好办了。……看好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0423_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d19d2657c5a13549c3cc4802a1cfdec46139b7775b0b74a7a7028bf339353f76", "ja": "（歩はその場で華麗にダンスの技を決めてみせた！\n周りから喝采が上がった！）", "zh": "（步当场展示了华丽的舞蹈动作！\n周围响起了喝彩声！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0423_1017_audience", "source_sha256": "be5b36bd260fee7418b8711f45ac983797c6c4a9be77a0818b8012d8b50539ac", "ja": "Ohhhh！　ペラペラペラペラペーラ！\nペラー！　ペラペラペラペラ、ペラペララー！", "zh": "Ohhhh！　哗啦哗啦哗啦哗啦哗——啦！\n哗啦——！　哗啦哗啦哗啦哗啦，哗啦哗啦啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0423_1018_audiences", "source_sha256": "4e82196fe11b3cd28ba8f9d084aa421121d1dcccb45ca9a4bebd690645aefae8", "ja": "ペラペーラペラペーラ！　ペラペラペラペラ……！？\nペラペラ、ペラペラペラペララー！？", "zh": "叽里呱啦叽里呱啦！　叽里叽里呱啦……！？\n叽里呱啦，叽里叽里呱啦啦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0423_1019_034ayu", "source_sha256": "62505e61ad365c8f528c2ffe9151dc2168427f88ea23e9a036fb64db682c4d58", "ja": "えっ！？　な、なに？\nお客さんが増えてるんだけど……！？", "zh": "诶！？怎、怎么回事？\n客人好像变多了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0423_1020_p", "source_sha256": "cdaa33fa720e58c318736baeca20aaceb38b0e5723a7b2f9462dba0b87953091", "ja": "歩のダンスで、テンションが上がったみたいだな。\nあと、質問もされてるみたいだけど……。", "zh": "看来是被步的舞蹈带动起来，情绪高涨了啊。\n好像还有人来提问……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0423_1021_034ayu", "source_sha256": "240d0a5b2d441731fad63be0745d772f6a1c7e71dd489405e615dae5028278d9", "ja": "マイガー！　そ、それはさすがに……あ、いや！\n{$P$}、助けて～！", "zh": "我的天！那、那也太夸张了……啊，不对！\n{$P$}，救救我～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
